experiment: restate
  Re-derives the numbers this project makes decisions on, against
  what it has written down. A red row does not mean the creature is
  broken -- it means a document is describing a creature that no
  longer exists, and anything built on that row is built on sand.

  --- m3probe, 200000 ticks x 3 creatures ---
  each trial 2000 ms, first 500 discarded; no learning, no reward
  instrument        m3probe   trial seed 000000000135367a   100 trials per sweep
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  '32 space' and '8x4 space+t' are 32 features each — the same budget
  spent on where the spikes were, or on where and when. 'shuffled'
  controls the space+t column.

