  quantity                               expected  measured  drift    verdict
  object at vocal, per neuron            0.667     0.667     -0.000   ok
  object at central, per neuron          0.693     0.693     +0.000   ok
  object at vision, per neuron           0.960     0.960     +0.000   ok
  word at vocal, per neuron              0.787     0.787     -0.000   ok
  word at auditory, per neuron           1.000     1.000     +0.000   ok
