  where each expectation is written down
    object at vocal, per neuron            README 'three caps': 0.660 over three seed FAMILIES -- NOT the old 0.500
    object at central, per neuron          README G3 cascade: the condition upstream of the larynx
    object at vision, per neuron           the positive control: if this falls, nothing else here is readable
    word at vocal, per neuron              the echo route -- what makes the creature able to repeat but not name
    word at auditory, per neuron           the auditory positive control
    vision->vocal trace conditionality     the tract that carries the object; central->vocal is a non-participant
    central->vocal trace conditionality    eligprobe: 0.742 at 5 creatures, NOT the long-recorded 0.654
    arcuate trace, size-matched            eligprobe's positive control -- a tract known to carry a condition

  restate PASS — every pinned number still describes this creature.

